* Front end H100 of the low-noise differential preamplifier note: 2 x JFE2140 per side at 5 mA, LSBF862 cascodes bootstrapped 3.5 V above the source node,
* THS4021 loop op amps, R_F 500 ohm, R_G 10.1 ohm (gain 100), C_I 9 pF, C_X 5 pF, C_node 220 pF.
* Input A driven (VIN, AC 1), input B grounded; outputs oa, ob.  Section 4.2 of the note.
.options reltol=1e-4 abstol=1e-15 vntol=1e-9 gmin=1e-14 itl1=500 itl4=200
.options rshunt=1e12
.include "../sim/models/_lib/jfets.lib"
.include "../sim/models/_lib/opamps.lib"
.include "../sim/models/_lib/bjts.lib"
.model rnl r(noisy=0)
VIN ina 0 DC 0 AC 1
RIA ina ga 1m rnl
RIB 0 gb 1m rnl
* ===== front end H100: 2 x JFE2140 per side at 5 mA, R_F 500, R_G 10.1, gain 100
VP vp 0 DC 15
VM vm 0 DC -15
VREF vref0 0 DC 9
RREF vref0 vref 1k rnl
CREF vref 0 10u
VSNK vsink0 0 DC -12.0599721
RSNK vsink0 vsink 1k rnl
CSNK vsink 0 10u
* --- side a
XJa1 da1 ga sa JFE2140
XCa1 ca ba da1 LSBF862
XJa2 da2 ga sa JFE2140
XCa2 ca ba da2 LSBF862
RBSa ba sa 3500
CBSa ba sa 1e-06
RUPa vp ba 10900
RDa vp ca 600
CIa oa ca 9e-12
CXa ob ca 5e-12
CNa ca 0 2.2e-10
XUa vref ca oa vp vm OA_THS4021
RFa oa sa 500
QTa sa vsink ea MMBT3904
RTa ea vm 181.818
* --- side b
XJb1 db1 gb sb JFE2140
XCb1 cb bb db1 LSBF862
XJb2 db2 gb sb JFE2140
XCb2 cb bb db2 LSBF862
RBSb bb sb 3500
CBSb bb sb 1e-06
RUPb vp bb 10900
RDb vp cb 600
CIb ob cb 9e-12
CXb oa cb 5e-12
CNb cb 0 2.2e-10
XUb vref cb ob vp vm OA_THS4021
RFb ob sb 500
QTb sb vsink eb MMBT3904
RTb eb vm 181.818
RG sa sb 10.1
.control
set wr_singlescale
set wr_vecnames
op
ac dec 40 1 1g
wrdata ac.txt v(oa) v(ob)
noise v(oa,ob) VIN dec 20 1 100meg
setplot noise2
print onoise_total
.endc
.end
